<h3><u>Qayd khaane mei</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p><strong><u>Qayd khaane mei</u></strong></p>

<p>(Haay Saadat aur zindan) x2</p>

<p>(Haaye sadaat haaye zindaan) x2</p>

<p>(Qaid khaane mein talaatum he ke hind aati hai) x2</p>

<ol>
 <li>Dukhtare Fatema ghairat se mui jaati he
 <p>Qaid khaane mein talaatum he ke hind aati hai</p>
 </li>
 <li>Aasman door zameen sakht kidhar jaaoun mein
 <p>Yahi behtar he ke dunya se guzar jaaoun mein</p>

 <p>Bibiyon milke duaa maango ke marjaaun mein</p>

 <p>Maut aati hi nahin jaan khichi jaati he</p>

 <p>Qaid khaane mein talaatum he ke hind aati hai</p>
 </li>
 <li>Amaad-e-hind ka ghul itrat-e-shabbir mein he
 <p>Shor-e-matam haram-e-saahib-e-tathir mein hein</p>

 <p>Kehti he jaaoun kahan paaon to zanjeer mein he</p>

 <p>Paaon uthta he to zanjir lipat jaati he</p>

 <p>Qaid khaane mein talaatum he ke hind aati hai</p>
 </li>
 <li>Aa idhar bibi Sakina se ye Zainab ka bayaan
 <p>Hind darbar se jab aayegi su-e-zindaan</p>

 <p>Sabr tum ko he dikhana na uthe shoro fughaan</p>

 <p>Haaye ye din bhi aseeri tumhe dikhlaati he</p>

 <p>Qaid khaane mein talaatum he ke hind aati hai</p>
 </li>
 <li>Dare zindaan pe huwa itne mein ambohe kamaal
 <p>Jaane haatim ka he zindaa(n) mein nuzoolo ijlaal</p>

 <p>Qaidiyon uth ke dua deke karo istikbaal</p>

 <p>Zawja-e-haakime doraan he jo ye aati he</p>

 <p>Qaid khaane mein talaatum he ke hind aati hai</p>
 </li>
 <li>Hind ne dekhke raandon ki taraf di ye sada
 <p>Kiska yusuf he ye zindaan mein giraftaare bala</p>

 <p>Bibiyaan kiski hai rakhti jo nahin sar pe rida</p>

 <p>Un ke chehron se to kuchh aur jhalak aati he</p>

 <p>Qaid khaane mein talaatum he ke hind aati hai</p>
 </li>
 <li>Dekhti kya he ke ik sher he aahan mein niha
 <p>Laagharo khastatanon faaqakasho Tashnadahaan</p>

 <p>Naa to chalne ki taqat he na koi rishtae jaan</p>

 <p>Ghustakhaanon se larazne ki sada aati he</p>

 <p>Qaid khaane mein talaatum he ke hind aati hai</p>
 </li>
 <li>Aayi nazdeek jo Sajjad ke Hind-e-dilgeer
 <p>Boli woh konsi isyan ki mili ye tazeer</p>

 <p>Bole dasween ki muharram ki joh pehni zanjeer</p>

 <p>Aaj taqdeer bhi qaidi humein kehlati he</p>

 <p>Qaid khaane mein talaatum he ke hind aati hai</p>
 </li>
 <li>Hind ne puchha maraz kya he kaha bepadari
 <p>Ghar jo daryaft kiya kehne lage darbadari</p>

 <p>Boli leta he khabar kon kaha bekhabari</p>

 <p>Jo khabargeer the unko to lahed bhaati he</p>

 <p>Qaid khaane mein talaatum he ke hind aati hai</p>
 </li>
 <li>Baba sahib ke gale par jo na khanjar phirta
 <p>Inke sar khulte na mein kaanton pe dar dar phirta</p>

 <p>Aur madine ki taraf sab ko mein le kar phirta</p>

 <p>Yaad hazrat mei watan ki humein tarpaati he</p>

 <p>Qaid khaane mein talaatum he ke hind aati hai</p>
 </li>
 <li>Hind ne naam madine ka jo abid se suna
 <p>Khaak par beth gayi haal ye taaqeer huwa</p>

 <p>Boli kya zainab-o-kulsum se nisbat he bhala</p>

 <p>Aise chehron se to khushbu-e-wafaa aati he</p>

 <p>Qaid khaane mein talaatum he ke hind aati hai</p>
 </li>
 <li>Boli Zainab ke na le Zainab-o-Kulthum ke naam
 <p>Woh nabi zaadiyan he qaid mein unka kya kaam</p>

 <p>Hind boli inhi baton mein hein sab un ka kalaam</p>

 <p>Kyun meri ruh tumhe dekh ke ghabraati he</p>

 <p>Qaid khaane mein talaatum he ke hind aati hai</p>
 </li>
 <li>Jo bhi surat he woh maasum nazar aati he
 <p>Qudrate khaaliq-e-qayyum nazar aati he</p>

 <p>Koi Zainab koi Kulsum nazar aati he</p>

 <p>Un se taqdeer ye kis haal mein milwaati he</p>

 <p>Qaid khaane mein talaatum he ke hind aati hai</p>
 </li>
 <li>Gird aabid ke phiri phir woh ba haal-e-tagheer
 <p>Bole woh kon ye chillai kaneez-e-Shabbir</p>

 <p>Assalaam ay rasan-o-tauq-o-salaasil ke aseer</p>

 <p>Nawha karti huwi qadmon mein giri jaati he</p>

 <p>Qaid khaane mein talaatum he ke hind aati hai</p>
 </li>
 <li>Bas &quot;Dabeer&quot; ab gham-e-shabbir se larzaa he jigar</li>
</ol>

<p>Hind bhi mehw-e-azaa aaj huwi nang-e-sar</p>

<p>Qaidkhaane mein huwa sina zani se mehshar</p>

<p>Yehi majlis he jo khud marsiya kehlaati he</p>

<p>Haaye sadaat aur zindaan</p>
</p>